  "abstract": "This is a re-run of the successful MoLR v1 experiment (ID 475) with an added analysis step. The previous analysis attempt (ID 477) was flawed as it used initialized, not trained, parameters. This submission utilizes the complete() function to access the final trained model parameters post-run. It will then visualize the learned shapes of the four non-linear ramp archetypes to provide insight into the model's learned temporal dynamics. The seed is fixed to 447516 for reproducibility.",
